    "expected_result_basis": [
      {
        "id": "rules",
        "derivation": "Bite Down has ordered targets: own Bear then opponent Bear (601.2c). Tapping Forests adds G without stack use (605.3b). Casting retains caster priority (117.3c), passes transfer it and two consecutive passes resolve only the top spell (117.4). Growth gives P1 Bear +3/+3, leaving Bite on stack; active P0 receives priority (117.3b). Bite reads P0 Bear power 2 on resolution (608.2h), so P1 5/5 survives 2 damage (704.5g). In cleanup damage removal and expiration happen simultaneously (514.2): P1 Bear remains the same battlefield object, now 2/2 with damage 0. With no SBA or trigger, cleanup offers no priority (514.3).",
        "citations": [
          "CR 117.3b",
          "CR 117.3c",
          "CR 117.3d",
          "CR 117.4",
          "CR 601.2c",
          "CR 601.2h",
          "CR 605.3b",
          "CR 608.2b",
          "CR 608.2h",
